                                                "sense_id": "d7705f17-a1b8-303d-8bc5-0e08b9095fc6",
                                                "text": "[T]he small Apples which I have often observ'd to grow on the leaves of an Oak call'd Oak-apples […] are nothing but the Matrices of an Insect, as I elsewhere show."
